OL,3,AWhite House removes cyber-security
OL,4,Achief after series of tech outages
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe top cyber-security official in the
OL,7,FUS government is leaving his post after
OL,8,Fa string of tech outages which hit the
OL,9,FNational Security Agency (NSA), the US
OL,10,Fair traffic control system and some
OL,11,Fbanks.
OL,13,FSean Cairncross had been national cyber
OL,14,Fdirector since August 2025.
OL,16,FCBS, the BBC's US news partner,
OL,17,Freported he had been fired after losing
OL,18,Fthe confidence of White House chief of
OL,19,Fstaff Stephen Miller.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
