OL,4,Achief after series of tech outages
OL,5,
OL,6,FSecretary of State Marco Rubio posted
OL,7,Fon X to say Department of Defense chief
OL,8,Finformation officer Kirsten Davies was
OL,9,Fthe new national cyber director.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
